{"page":70,"width":1890,"height":2847,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"3.2 프로세스 스케출링","words":[{"text":"3.2","x":1252,"y":176,"width":58,"height":24},{"text":"프로세스","x":1327,"y":176,"width":101,"height":29},{"text":"스케출링","x":1436,"y":176,"width":98,"height":30}]},{"text":"123","words":[{"text":"123","x":1613,"y":173,"width":59,"height":30}]},{"text":"3.2","words":[{"text":"3.2","x":186,"y":993,"width":92,"height":39}]},{"text":"단지 한 가지 일만 실행하도록 허용한다. 따라서 사용자는 문지를 입력하면서 동시에 철","words":[{"text":"단지","x":321,"y":314,"width":63,"height":40},{"text":"한","x":402,"y":315,"width":33,"height":39},{"text":"가지","x":450,"y":315,"width":62,"height":40},{"text":"일만","x":531,"y":316,"width":66,"height":38},{"text":"실행하도록","x":611,"y":316,"width":167,"height":40},{"text":"허용한다.","x":794,"y":318,"width":141,"height":39},{"text":"따라서","x":953,"y":315,"width":96,"height":40},{"text":"사용자는","x":1067,"y":314,"width":137,"height":40},{"text":"문지를","x":1217,"y":314,"width":104,"height":39},{"text":"입력하면서","x":1337,"y":314,"width":166,"height":40},{"text":"동시에","x":1521,"y":314,"width":102,"height":39},{"text":"철","x":1641,"y":315,"width":31,"height":38}]},{"text":"자 김사기를 실행할 수 없다. 대부분의 현대 운영체제는 프로세스 개념을 확장하여 한","words":[{"text":"자","x":322,"y":380,"width":32,"height":38},{"text":"김사기를","x":373,"y":380,"width":133,"height":39},{"text":"실행할","x":525,"y":381,"width":99,"height":39},{"text":"수","x":640,"y":382,"width":33,"height":38},{"text":"없다.","x":692,"y":381,"width":72,"height":39},{"text":"대부분의","x":786,"y":382,"width":129,"height":39},{"text":"현대","x":937,"y":382,"width":63,"height":39},{"text":"운영체제는","x":1020,"y":380,"width":171,"height":40},{"text":"프로세스","x":1208,"y":379,"width":138,"height":39},{"text":"개념을","x":1365,"y":379,"width":102,"height":39},{"text":"확장하여","x":1483,"y":379,"width":135,"height":39},{"text":"한","x":1639,"y":379,"width":36,"height":37}]},{"text":"프로세스가 다수의 실행 스레드를 가질 수 있도록 허용한다. 그들은 따라서 프로세스가","words":[{"text":"프로세스가","x":322,"y":445,"width":169,"height":39},{"text":"다수의","x":506,"y":446,"width":96,"height":38},{"text":"실행","x":623,"y":446,"width":61,"height":39},{"text":"스레드를","x":703,"y":446,"width":135,"height":39},{"text":"가질","x":854,"y":448,"width":63,"height":38},{"text":"수","x":934,"y":448,"width":34,"height":38},{"text":"있도록","x":985,"y":447,"width":101,"height":38},{"text":"허용한다.","x":1101,"y":445,"width":143,"height":40},{"text":"그들은","x":1261,"y":445,"width":105,"height":38},{"text":"따라서","x":1382,"y":445,"width":98,"height":40},{"text":"프로세스가","x":1500,"y":443,"width":175,"height":38}]},{"text":"한 번에 하나 이상의 일을 수행할 수 있도록 허용한다. 이러한 특성은 특히 다중 처리기","words":[{"text":"한","x":321,"y":511,"width":34,"height":37},{"text":"번에","x":371,"y":510,"width":62,"height":38},{"text":"하나","x":452,"y":511,"width":66,"height":38},{"text":"이상의","x":533,"y":510,"width":95,"height":39},{"text":"일을","x":649,"y":511,"width":64,"height":38},{"text":"수행할","x":728,"y":512,"width":101,"height":38},{"text":"수","x":843,"y":512,"width":33,"height":39},{"text":"있도록","x":893,"y":512,"width":99,"height":39},{"text":"허용한다.","x":1008,"y":512,"width":141,"height":39},{"text":"이러한","x":1168,"y":510,"width":102,"height":40},{"text":"특성은","x":1282,"y":510,"width":106,"height":40},{"text":"특히","x":1401,"y":510,"width":66,"height":39},{"text":"다중","x":1486,"y":509,"width":69,"height":40},{"text":"처리기","x":1571,"y":508,"width":98,"height":40}]},{"text":"시스템에서 이익을 얻을 수 있는데, 여러 스레드가 병렬로 실행될 수 있다. 예를 들어, 다","words":[{"text":"시스템에서","x":323,"y":576,"width":164,"height":38},{"text":"이익을","x":505,"y":576,"width":98,"height":37},{"text":"얻을","x":619,"y":576,"width":64,"height":38},{"text":"수","x":696,"y":577,"width":34,"height":37},{"text":"있는데,","x":744,"y":576,"width":108,"height":40},{"text":"여러","x":867,"y":577,"width":62,"height":39},{"text":"스레드가","x":946,"y":577,"width":136,"height":39},{"text":"병렬로","x":1096,"y":576,"width":100,"height":40},{"text":"실행될","x":1210,"y":576,"width":100,"height":39},{"text":"수","x":1324,"y":577,"width":36,"height":37},{"text":"있다.","x":1375,"y":576,"width":73,"height":39},{"text":"예를","x":1465,"y":576,"width":68,"height":38},{"text":"들어,","x":1546,"y":574,"width":78,"height":40},{"text":"다","x":1639,"y":574,"width":34,"height":39}]},{"text":"중 스레드 워드 프로세서는 하나의 스레드에 A卜일자 입력 관리를 맡기는 동안 다른 스레","words":[{"text":"중","x":321,"y":642,"width":33,"height":36},{"text":"스레드","x":368,"y":641,"width":100,"height":38},{"text":"워드","x":484,"y":641,"width":65,"height":37},{"text":"프로세서는","x":563,"y":641,"width":169,"height":39},{"text":"하나의","x":745,"y":641,"width":97,"height":39},{"text":"스레드에","x":859,"y":642,"width":133,"height":38},{"text":"A卜일자","x":1008,"y":641,"width":102,"height":40},{"text":"입력","x":1125,"y":642,"width":61,"height":38},{"text":"관리를","x":1203,"y":641,"width":104,"height":39},{"text":"맡기는","x":1321,"y":641,"width":104,"height":38},{"text":"동안","x":1437,"y":640,"width":70,"height":40},{"text":"다른","x":1521,"y":640,"width":69,"height":39},{"text":"스레","x":1602,"y":640,"width":66,"height":39}]},{"text":"드가 철자 겸사기를 수행하도록 만들 수 있다. 스레드를 지원하는 시스템에서는 PCB는","words":[{"text":"드가","x":321,"y":705,"width":68,"height":39},{"text":"철자","x":404,"y":706,"width":66,"height":38},{"text":"겸사기를","x":486,"y":705,"width":132,"height":39},{"text":"수행하도록","x":632,"y":706,"width":171,"height":38},{"text":"만들","x":817,"y":707,"width":66,"height":37},{"text":"수","x":897,"y":708,"width":34,"height":37},{"text":"있다.","x":947,"y":707,"width":72,"height":39},{"text":"스레드를","x":1037,"y":707,"width":135,"height":39},{"text":"지원하는","x":1188,"y":706,"width":136,"height":39},{"text":"시스템에서는","x":1339,"y":706,"width":207,"height":38},{"text":"PCB는","x":1560,"y":707,"width":112,"height":37}]},{"text":"각 스레드에 관한 정보를 포함하도록 확장된다. 스레드를 지원하기 위해서는 시스템 전","words":[{"text":"각","x":321,"y":771,"width":33,"height":37},{"text":"스레드에","x":369,"y":771,"width":132,"height":38},{"text":"관한","x":519,"y":771,"width":68,"height":37},{"text":"정보를","x":603,"y":771,"width":99,"height":38},{"text":"포함하도록","x":717,"y":771,"width":170,"height":39},{"text":"확장된다.","x":902,"y":772,"width":142,"height":39},{"text":"스레드를","x":1062,"y":772,"width":136,"height":39},{"text":"지원하기","x":1214,"y":771,"width":131,"height":40},{"text":"위해서는","x":1366,"y":771,"width":139,"height":39},{"text":"시스템","x":1520,"y":771,"width":99,"height":39},{"text":"전","x":1640,"y":772,"width":31,"height":38}]},{"text":"반에 걸친 다른 수정도 필요하다. 과에서 스레드에 대해 상세하게 탐구한다.","words":[{"text":"반에","x":321,"y":836,"width":63,"height":38},{"text":"걸친","x":401,"y":836,"width":65,"height":38},{"text":"다른","x":481,"y":836,"width":67,"height":39},{"text":"수정도","x":560,"y":836,"width":101,"height":39},{"text":"필요하다.","x":675,"y":836,"width":142,"height":39},{"text":"과에서","x":832,"y":837,"width":118,"height":39},{"text":"스레드에","x":967,"y":837,"width":132,"height":39},{"text":"대해","x":1116,"y":837,"width":64,"height":39},{"text":"상세하게","x":1196,"y":837,"width":133,"height":39},{"text":"탐구한다.","x":1345,"y":836,"width":146,"height":39}]},{"text":"프로세스 스케줄림 Process scheduling","words":[{"text":"프로세스","x":321,"y":990,"width":157,"height":39},{"text":"스케줄림","x":492,"y":991,"width":155,"height":46},{"text":"Process","x":682,"y":1003,"width":158,"height":27},{"text":"scheduling","x":852,"y":1002,"width":211,"height":35}]},{"text":"다중 프로그래밍의 목적은 CPU 이용을 최대화하기 위하여 항상 어떤 프로세스가 실행","words":[{"text":"다중","x":321,"y":1092,"width":66,"height":39},{"text":"프로그래밍의","x":401,"y":1093,"width":201,"height":39},{"text":"목적은","x":619,"y":1093,"width":104,"height":39},{"text":"CPU","x":736,"y":1096,"width":83,"height":31},{"text":"이용을","x":836,"y":1093,"width":103,"height":39},{"text":"최대화하기","x":955,"y":1094,"width":165,"height":39},{"text":"위하여","x":1140,"y":1094,"width":97,"height":38},{"text":"항상","x":1254,"y":1092,"width":70,"height":39},{"text":"어떤","x":1339,"y":1092,"width":66,"height":39},{"text":"프로세스가","x":1421,"y":1092,"width":176,"height":38},{"text":"실행","x":1611,"y":1092,"width":66,"height":38}]},{"text":"되도록 하는 데 있다. 시분할의 목적은 각 프로그램이 실행되는 동안 사용자가 상호 작","word